# Settings window: Material 1040x700 at 440,205 (page column from x~772); Glass 860x620 at 530,230. Sidebar rows (Material, x=560): Appearance 335, Wallpaper 385, Desktop 435, Menu bar 485, Lock 535, Notifications 626, Focus 676, Windows 767, Displays 858.
# Click coordinates inside pages are not known in advance: those steps are MANUAL unless a keyboard path exists. Check in each look.
ipc panels settings mouse
wait 2
shot i1
note I1 same mice/trackpads with their settings and three-finger drag row as QML.
ipc panels settings mouse/gestures
wait 2
shot i2
note I2 same gesture list and texts as QML.
ipc panels settings shortcuts
wait 2
shot i3
note I3 same groups, keys and mod key as QML.
# MANUAL: I4 disable one shortcut with its switch, Undo in the toast: disabled then back, keybinds.json unchanged
# MANUAL: I5 Keyboard > Export... with typed path ~/Documents/test-shortcuts.json: 'Exported to ~/Documents/test-shortcuts.json'
# MANUAL: I6 Import... that file: preview lists 0 changes or the same as QML; Cancel
# MANUAL: I7 Keyboard > Dictation: binary/model state and model list as QML
# MANUAL: I8 Live Text languages: tesseract installed state and language list as QML
# MANUAL: never install/download/remove dictation, installOcr or apply an import
